# What does NOT go into the VSIX.
#
# There was no .vscodeignore until 2026-10-08, so every build shipped the whole
# TypeScript source tree and 1.6 MB of source maps. The artifact was clean of
# secrets, but it handed the complete source to anyone who unzipped it — more
# than is intended while the repo is private and the license is undecided (D19).
#
# Only `dist/` is loaded at runtime (`main` in package.json). `out/` is a second,
# duplicate build from tsc; the source, the build config and the maps are inputs.

# Build inputs — not needed to run.
src/**
scripts/**
tsconfig.json
esbuild.mjs
package.vsix.json

# A duplicate build. `main` points at dist/extension.js, never at out/.
out/**

# Source maps. These are what carried the source back in.
**/*.map

node_modules/**
